#. …ッ！！
msgctxt "0001 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "...!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…ん？　何か話したい事でもあるのかな？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Huh? Does she want to talk to me\n"
"about something?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …どうしたの、腐川さん？
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Toko...what's wrong?"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0004 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. ………………
msgctxt "0005 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>何か伝えようとしている…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Is she...trying to say something?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>何か…もう少しで伝わりそうな…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I think she's almost...! Just a little more and I\n"
"might get it...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0008 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. やっぱり、無理だよ。
#. まったく伝わらないし…
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry, but...I have no idea what it is\n"
"you're trying to tell me."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0010 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>腐川さんは、
#. 寂しそうに肩を落としている。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>She just let her shoulders drop. She looks so sad. I\n"
"guess she gave up...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>時計なんか見ても…仕方がないな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looking at the clock isn't gonna help anything.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>本来の教室なら窓があるべき場所だけど…
#. そこには、やっぱり鉄板が打ち付けられている。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is where a window would be in a normal classroom.\n"
"But there's some huge metal plate mounted over it now.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>こっちも鉄板…あっちも鉄板か…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Metal plate here... Metal plate over there, too.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>本来の教室なら窓があるべき場所だけど…
#. そこには、やっぱり鉄板が打ち付けられている。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is where a window would be in a normal classroom.\n"
"But there's some huge metal plate mounted over it now.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>この階も鉄板で覆われてる…
#. まったく…ウンザリだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This floor has been sealed up with sheets of metal,\n"
"too. I'm so sick of this...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0017 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0018 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0019 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0020 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0021 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0022 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
